# Most Important Insight

This project is closer to:

## Document Structure Replication

NOT:

## Chatbot / QA / Traditional RAG

The entire system must focus on:
- structure preservation
- legal formatting preservation
- constrained generation
- court-style reconstruction

---

# Final Key Rule

Do NOT:
- chunk randomly
- retrieve semantically only
- generate full document in one prompt

Instead:
- parse structurally
- retrieve structurally
- generate structurally
